{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我无视了他的话。某种意义上来说，这也是恋爱中的男生所特有的优越感吧。", "steam": "故作平靜的我，在某種意義上是戀愛中男生矜持的極致。"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.37}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "但是，我正是因此态度才会转变如此之快，恋爱……真的是一种罪过也说不定。", "steam": "但是，連這種狀況也能讓人欣然接受，戀愛真的是一種罪過啊。"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.291}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "不管怎样，时间在一点一滴地接近。", "steam": "總之，時間一分一秒地接近。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 13}, "similarity": 0.4}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "那一天大概会成为我们的纪念日吧。", "steam": "大概會成為我們的紀念日的那一天。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.667}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "不任由欲望冲动行事，而是像这样一步一步向前迈进——", "steam": "我們沒有衝動進行，而是確實地一步一步做準備──"}, "length": {"chs": 25, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.304}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "如此这般，正因为将“那一天”看的无比重要，所以在那之前的一分一秒都会让我们的氛围更上一层楼。", "steam": "因為「那一天」的那個行為是如此重要，所以連此時的一分一秒都成為了醞釀出氣氛的助力。"}, "length": {"chs": 46, "steam": 41}, "similarity": 0.513}
